id: sl_si91x_basic_buffers
package: wifi
description: >
  This component implements a malloc-based buffer system for the SiWx91x

  Deprecated: This component is retained only for backward compatibility and
  should not be added to new applications. It has been superseded by
  `sli_buffer_manager`, which is pulled in automatically by the
  `sl_si91x_wireless` component, so no explicit inclusion is required.
label: Basic Buffer Manager
category: Device|Si91x|Wireless|Buffer Manager
quality: deprecated
metadata:
